{"steam_appid":1519710,"steam_name":"SCHiM","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1519710/731924/71849c7dd5719bd3f8ba52d3f7247265068d5b57/1750998191/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722101985","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257041241/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722101985","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/ss_282ba251edcc88962884a3a0e6db4e6dbe505cba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773842252","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/ss_27952fe5057179e262faa6c08e06f1342999d85c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773842252","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/ss_94e0ffa619a4a6a7c899e45d5a4f35fbf0e076f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773842252","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/ss_ae31046b30a1cfb1abfeb6d221a2317a4eeb4a2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773842252","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/ss_170c82f172e053374d5615e91ddab1ed46bd9d33.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773842252"],"about_the_game":"SCHiM is a game about jumping from shadow to shadow, while interacting with a relaxing and lively environment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a schim?</h2>A schim is the soul and spirit of an object, thing, or living being. Everything in the world has one. A schim should never be separated from their thing! This does happen to your schim, this schim who is attached to a human being is separated from them early on in the game.<br><br>Can you get back to them before it's too late?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/d3bb00b1ff92ec3773888b23ca6f7947.poster.avif?t=1773842252\" width=600 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/d3bb00b1ff92ec3773888b23ca6f7947.webm?t=1773842252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/d3bb00b1ff92ec3773888b23ca6f7947.mp4?t=1773842252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique 3D platforming through shadows.<br></li><li>Animated shadow platforms and environments.<br></li><li>Each level has its own scenery with small stories.<br></li><li>A story of a person losing their shadow.<br></li><li>A beautiful abstract world.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/a9b1afeb7858bb7c90bde85ef5405811.poster.avif?t=1773842252\" width=600 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/a9b1afeb7858bb7c90bde85ef5405811.webm?t=1773842252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519710/extras/a9b1afeb7858bb7c90bde85ef5405811.mp4?t=1773842252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2Quad Q6600 2,40 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 650 (1024 MB Ram)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Ewoud van der Werf","Nils Slijkerman"],"publishers":["Extra Nice","PLAYISM"],"release_date":"18 Jul, 2024"}